description:
1. The main purpose of the website is e-commerce and corporate.
2. The primary products or services offered are a home gym and fitness equipment, specifically the Tonal system.
3. The target audience appears to be individuals interested in at-home workouts and fitness training.
4. Notable features include:
	* A membership program with personalized training and coaching;
	* Science-backed workouts with real-time guidance;
	* Adjustable resistance based on user strength; 
	* Financing options for purchasing the Tonal system.
